    "18": {
      "note": "linkage_report is the surviving observation surface; it does not mirror task_doc.get. Non-dry reporting writes JSON and answers factKinds/reportPath under enclosure reports or the UTC-day detail folder; an unwritable destination is a named failure. Dry run computes facts without that per-call report. Best-effort reclamation keeps the bounded 50-member report group. Fact collection remains tolerant, but the whole reporting operation is not guaranteed never to raise. Attach/detach preserve their per-document previews internally; bounded task delivery uses aggregate diff/wouldLose, not rendered document dumps.",
